# Deployment

- Single Worker: `wrangler deploy` from `apps/web` only
- Staging: push `develop` → `--env staging`
- Production: tag `v*` → `--env production`
- Never use Cloudflare Pages or `wrangler pages deploy`
- Secrets via `wrangler secret put` / `.dev.vars` locally — never commit
